                "dsDescriptionValue": {
                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionValue",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "Databases YMP (data0.YMP.R5) and Soltherm (Soltherm H06, latest update June 2016), converted to a format suitable for thermodynamic modelling software PHREEQC. Converted set only - credit of the original databases go to the creators as mentioned in Alsemgeest et al, 2021.\r\n\r\nIncluding Source code to convert from TOUGHREACT/GeoT format to PHREEQC"
                },
